Elastic Common Schema
---------------------

rmig/data/wcs-fields.csv is a copy of the Wazuh Common Schema field list (wazuh-indexer-plugins). Its ECS fields
(names, descriptions, examples) come from the Elastic Common Schema; the Wazuh-specific fields do not.

